{"seq":2,"slug":"ui-and-integration-testing","title":"UI 与集成测试","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/ui-and-integration-testing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"xcuitest-basics","title":"XCUITest UI 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/ui-and-integration-testing/xcuitest-basics","wordCount":1827,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"testability-page-objects","title":"可测试性与 Page Object","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/ui-and-integration-testing/testability-page-objects","wordCount":2227,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"snapshot-testing","title":"快照测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/ui-and-integration-testing/snapshot-testing","wordCount":2609,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ui-与集成测试-简介\">UI 与集成测试 简介</h1><p>单元测试守住单个逻辑，但「整个流程串起来是否正常」要靠 UI 与集成测试。本章讲清这一层：先是 <strong>XCUITest 基础</strong>（用 UI 自动化模拟用户操作——录制、查询元素、交互、断言），然后是<strong>可测试性</strong>（用 <code>accessibilityIdentifier</code> 让元素可稳定定位、用 page object 模式组织 UI 测试不至于脆弱），最后是<strong>快照测试</strong>（截屏对比捕捉 UI 回归——它的价值与陷阱）。UI 测试慢且脆，要克制地用、用对地方。掌握这一层，让你能验证关键用户流程端到端可用，又不被一堆脆弱的 UI 测试拖累。</p>\n"}